Section: 3. APPROACH
Text: The embeddings are trained using skip-gram approach with a window of size 7 and 5 iterations. The dimension of the embeddings is ﬁxed to 200. [21] have shown that the skip-gram word embedding model is in fact a linear decomposition of the cooccurrence matrix. This decomposition is unique up to a linear transfor- mation. Therefore, given two word representations created from the same cooccurrence matrix, a linear transform can be devised to map words from the ﬁrst to the second.

