Section: 2 Related Work
Text: Artetxe and Schwenk (2018) use the sequence encoder of the mul- tilingual translation model (Johnson et al. 2017) to produce cross-lingual sentence embeddings. However, as shown in the experiments (Section 4), it is difﬁcult to control the tar- get language by directly ﬁne-tuning the pre-trained transla- tion model on downstream NLG tasks.

Rank: 3
