Text: study, BAS speciﬁc word embeddings were trained (BSWE) inspired by Tang et al. [22]’s model: Sentiment-Speciﬁc Word Embedding (uniﬁed model: SSWEu). After obtaining the word vectors via BSWE, the same scheme was used to average the vectors in one sentence as in the model AV GWV EC. 3.2 Classiﬁcation and evaluation The learned word embeddings are input into a classiﬁer as features under a supervised machine learning framework.

