Text: Similar to sentiment classiﬁ- cation using word embeddings [22], where they try to predict each tweet to be either positive or negative, in the task of AZ, the embeddings are used to classify each sentence into one of the seven categories. To evaluate the classiﬁcation performance, precision, recall and F- measure were computed. 4 Experimental Evaluation 4.1 Training Dataset ACL collection.

